							Hey Dude, Nice Idea going there. I&#039;ve got abunch of group screen shots of random people waiting for MGBs, etc.. and some scenery ones if you want em. And as for songs, well the only ones that would partially kinda almost go with that are:<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13406#msg13406">Quote from: Vesi on December 26, 2004, 09:12:43 am</a></div><div class="quote">Enya - Only Time<br /></div><br />Three Doors Down - Here Without You.<br />Good Charlotte - Say Anything.<br /><br />Goodluck with the video man, if you need my Screenshots just PM me and i&#039;ll see what I can do about getting some more. Although I&#039;m gone on Vacation this week, 26-31st, I&#039;ll get back to ya then. :-)
