								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13408#msg13408">Re: It's been 6 years of Everquest now.  I need help, your help.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> December 26, 2004, 10:33:14 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13407#msg13407">Quote from: Naithein on December 26, 2004, 10:01:42 am</a></div><div class="quote">Hey Dude, Nice Idea going there. I&#039;ve got abunch of group screen shots of random people waiting for MGBs, etc.. and some scenery ones if you want em. And as for songs, well the only ones that would partially kinda almost go with that are:<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13406#msg13406">Quote from: Vesi on December 26, 2004, 09:12:43 am</a></div><div class="quote">Enya - Only Time<br /></div><br />Edit: Btw this process will take a couple weeks.  So what I intend to do is write down all the songs.  And go listen to them.  And then after a week or two of gather suggestions for songs and screenshots.  I&#039;ll either decide myself, or based off view and amount of songs. I&#039;ll provide a list of the ones I can use best and allow a vote. And take the top 2 or 3 and use them.  <br /><br />So please... please...make your suggestions.<br />Three Doors Down - Here Without You.<br />Good Charlotte - Say Anything.<br /><br />Goodluck with the video man, if you need my Screenshots just PM me and i&#039;ll see what I can do about getting some more. Although I&#039;m gone on Vacation this week, 26-31st, I&#039;ll get back to ya then. :-)<br /></div><br />Trust me, you can fit alot of screenshots with different kinds of music.  So I appreciate all screenshots.  You can attach them here or send them too <a href="mailto:screenshots@eelyen.com">screenshots@eelyen.com</a> (an email I specically created for screenshots).  <br /><br />but your song suggestions will most definitly be considered.  I&#039;m going for an emotion when people will see the movie, for the first time.  I want them to feel it.  It won&#039;t be the best.  But when someone views it for the first time, I want them to feel the emotion of the song...while they view the screenshots.  I want the screenshots and the music to give an overall image.  <br /><br />I will be more then happy to add the screenshots from people from around RN as best I can.   <br /><br />Again, it&#039;s far easier to make the screenshots move to the music...then the music move to the screenshots.  So once I go the songs decided...it&#039;s a matter of adding screenshots to the flash...and making them move to the music.
						</td>
					</tr>
