								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=200"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.fotguild.com" title="Fires of Time Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13409#msg13409"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13409#msg13409">Re: It's been 6 years of Everquest now.  I need help, your help.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> December 26, 2004, 10:58:49 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							After listening to a couple more songs I was thinking about. If you&#039;d like to add your story to this.  A simple story or a small story you&#039;d like to see in the flash, a general story. An opening, a middle, and an ending. Simple or detailed if you like.  Please add it.  It might help me adjust the story I&#039;d like to tell withing pictures.  <br /><br />Stories can be told many ways.  From beginning to end. ..  From the end ... followed by the beginning.    Or a variation of those.  <br /><br />Anything anyone feels to add to this is fine.   The email address is open for screenshots.  Compressed or not.  There is plenty of space.<br /><br />So please, add your opinion, your view...your story.  Help make the story I tell, your story.  Even if it isn&#039;t all your story.... it&#039;s our story.<br /><br />Edit: I wish for each of you that reads this and contributes, to be able to watch the movie in the near future and feel a relation to it in some way.   Then in some way, it is your story, it is our story. <br /><br />I don&#039;t have a ton of screenshots from 6 years ago till now due to reinstalls and crashes.  I need you help.<br /><br />I want to make this more then my story.  I want to make this a story that all can feel.  And it should most definitly be about Rodcet Nife, as I spent so much of my time here.&nbsp; Help me make this story, your story...
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
