	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13412"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=214" title="View the profile of Stargazeron">Stargazeron</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 25<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=214"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13412#msg13412"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1360.msg13412#msg13412">Re: It's been 6 years of Everquest now.  I need help, your help.</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> December 26, 2004, 07:52:33 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I personally think that if you&#039;re looking for quality music for an EQ soundtrack, you need to deviate a bit from the normal.<br /><br />Rock music is good, but really I think having music with too much lyrics distracts the viewer from what else is being shown.<br /><br />With that in mind, here are my suggestions:<br /><br />Blackwatch - Northsky<br />Propellerheads - Spybreak<br />Rob D. - Clubbed to Death<br />Darude - Sandstorm<br />Kernkraft 4000 - Zombie Nation<br /><br />Some other goods songs with a slight bit more lyrics<br />Sabel - Song to the Siren<br />Dream Theatre - Pull Me Under<br />Filter - Hey Man Nice Shot<br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
